target:    src/Tracker/Processor.php
gate:      php tests/tracker-repair-gate-test.php
kind:      guard-removal
expect:    the tracking path calls init_environment() directly
rationale: D24/D25 requires that every DDL recovery from the tracking path goes through the gated entry point. This calls init_environment() directly from process(). The gate MUST see it — and before I1 it did not, because the assertion also required repairSchemaOnce() to be absent, which it never is.
---
--- a/src/Tracker/Processor.php
+++ b/src/Tracker/Processor.php
@@ -755,6 +755,7 @@ class Processor
         $stat['id'] = Storage::insertRow($stat, $GLOBALS['wpdb']->prefix . 'slim_stats');
 
         if (false === $stat['id']) {
+            \wp_slimstat_admin::init_environment();
             if (self::repairSchemaOnce()) {
                 $stat['id'] = Storage::insertRow($stat, $GLOBALS['wpdb']->prefix . 'slim_stats');
             }
